# ProbCapital Marketing Site - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development
# DO NOT COMMIT .env.local to git!

# ============================================
# Twelve Data API Key (for live ticker)
# ============================================
# OPTIONAL: Use the same API key as dashboard (TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY)
# With VITE_ prefix for Vite to expose it to client
#
# HOW IT WORKS:
# - If set: Makes 1 REST API call on page load for real initial prices
#           Then simulates small price changes every 4 seconds
#           Cost: ~1 REST credit per visitor to homepage
#
# - If not set: Uses fallback prices + simulation
#               Cost: 0 API credits
#
# RECOMMENDATION: Leave empty for marketing site to conserve API limits
#                 Real quotes are critical only in the dashboard (trading)
#
VITE_TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=
